                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Target unit gains Stealth until your next Psychic Phase. Target unit suffers -1 to Cover Saves until your next Psychic Phase.</characteristic>
